<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Verify Your Email</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <h2 style="color: #4CAF50; margin-top: 0;">Welcome to Axgrin!</h2>
    <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
    <p>Thank you for signing up! Please verify your email address by clicking the link below:</p>
    <div style="margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" style="background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;">Verify Email Address</a>
    </div>
    <p>This link will expire in 24 hours for security reasons.</p>
    <p>If you didn't create an account with Axgrin, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    <p>Best regards,<br>The Axgrin Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
